<Platform title="About"><header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Hello, we’re Digivated</p><h1>Room for what<br/>you’re building.</h1><p class="lede">Digivated is being built as an open space for people creating things online.</p></header><div class="about-copy"><p>I’m Langston, the person behind Digivated. I want this to be a useful place to share your work, find inspiration, and discover people making things of their own.</p><div class="about-values"><div><h2>Share your work.</h2><p>Put what you’re creating out into the world.</p></div><div><h2>Discover projects.</h2><p>Find interesting ideas and the people behind them.</p></div><div><h2>Keep learning.</h2><p>Find useful resources for your next step.</p></div><div><h2>Connect with builders.</h2><p>Follow a creator’s links and get to know their work.</p></div></div><p>I personally select projects for Digivated Picks. Selected community projects may also be reposted by Digivated for additional exposure. Submitting does not guarantee a feature or repost.</p><p>Digivated also creates its own digital products, beginning with the <a href="/ui-ux-prompt-packet">UI/UX Prompt Packet</a>.</p><p><a class="button" href="/about-langston">More about the person behind Digivated</a></p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/submit-project">Share what you’re building</a><a class="button" href="/discover">Explore projects</a></div></div></Platform>
